DOM: XML documents through the Document Object Model API, with libxml2
of the package az.

The module dom of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/dom.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/dom.
